# .clang-format: the code style, applied by clang-format and checked in CI.
#
# What it does: LLVM style with 4-space indents and 100-character lines. Includes are not re-sorted,
#   so each file keeps its include groups in the order they were written.

BasedOnStyle: LLVM
ColumnLimit: 100
IndentWidth: 4
AccessModifierOffset: -4
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
FixNamespaceComments: true
ReflowComments: true
SortIncludes: Never